  "basic_info_description": "AVAILABLE NOW with 1 week notice\n\nThis spacious and beautifully remodeled home combines the details, craftmanship and\ncharm of the period it was built, along with modern style and conveniences of today. It is\nlocated in the Excelsior neighborhood (a few steps to Persia Street) with great public\ntransportation including MUNI a few steps away and short distance to Balboa Park\nBART station. Arteries to freeways 101 and 280 provide access to other areas of the\ncity or for commuting to the Peninsula or South Bay. Enjoy being close to McLaren\nPark, Balboa Park and several other parks and playgrounds for outdoor activities.\n\nThis home boasts on the Main Level:\n-Formal entry foyer with closet\n-Formal living room with decorative fireplace, built-in cabinets, barrel style paned\nfront windows that bring in lots of light\n-Formal dining room accessed from the living room through the beautiful French\nstyle doors with beveled glass, the hallway or the kitchen\n-Kitchen with stainless steel appliances, including: French style refrigerator, gas\nstove with vented hood, dishwasher\n-2 bedrooms; including the spacious primary suite with walk-in closet\n-2 bathrooms; primary bathroom has stall shower and 2nd bathroom has shower\nover tub\n-Washer/dryer on this floor\n\nOn the Lower Level:\n-2 bedrooms\n-1 bathroom with stall shower\n-Family room\n\nOther details:\n-Beautiful original hardwood floors with patterned details\n-Original crown ceiling details\n-Spacious backyard with 2 mature lemon trees and nice landscaping\n-1 car garage\n\nPets not allowed\nNo smoking\nUtilities: Tenant pays utilities\n\nRent $7200\nDeposit $7200\nApplication fee $45\n\nListing Agent:\nEugenia \"Genie\" Mantzoros, Realtor and Luxury Leasing Agent\nCalDRE #00805386\n\nFor Viewing Schedule:\nFritzie Anfone",
